  "fit": {
    "method": "resume-fit-v2",
    "threshold_percent": 60,
    "rubric": "Score the advert against automation/facts.json only. Start at 50. Add up to +25 for role level (junior, graduate, cadet, trainee, entry drafter or site support roles score highest; roles asking 2+ years commercial experience score low). Add up to +15 for discipline overlap (civil road, earthworks, pavement, drainage, civil documentation, site coordination, inspections, records; Civil 3D and AutoCAD; Revit). Add up to +10 for location fit (Melbourne west and Victoria highest; regional, FIFO and Central Queensland acceptable; anywhere in Australia allowed when relocation is realistic). Subtract 40 if a mandatory requirement cannot be met (citizenship or PR required, a licence Marc does not hold, degree from a named country only). Subtract 15 for 'must have Australian experience'. Subtract 10 if the advert is a recruitment agency with no named employer. Never guess: an unknown mandatory detail is a gap, not a fail. The result is a rough fit, not an interview forecast."
  },
